#reward10
From : Colonel K.Rorscham
       Vandaum Headquarters

For : % &
      Island of Piran

Well done you struck a decisive blow at Riga-Soro.
The Petra archipelago is nearly under our control.

Nearly... in effect two strongholds remain.
First of all the Communist island of Sira to the NORTH
EAST and the island of Mina to the SOUTH WEST held by
the Capitalists.

Teams of Bombardiers have volounteered for this last
operation. An air base has been established on a small
island to the WEST of your base, from where you will be
able to launch air raids on enemy bases.

Remember that these bombers are very vulnerable
without escort fighters. If you become master of the air 
space, you will be able to judge their efficiency.
Make sure you do not sacrifice the lives of these pilots.

A stupid defeat would ruin your efforts and hopes for a  
career.